@{FG text}


@{IMG "GUIDEDIR:files/darkseed.jpg"}

Written in 1992 by Mike Dawson and Mike Cranford
CD32 release 1994 with full speech (actual)

Horror mystery set in and around a dark and gruesome world
based on the drawings of Alien artist H.R Giger.
Man wakes up in his new house, only to discover that a mirror
in the living room is a portal to an alien world, where
creatures are planning to conquer our world!

@{" Download " SYSTEM "c:execute DarkSeed"}

It's downloading the file, about 16MB be patient
You find it in RAM Disk

Game runs in WHDL


@{FG shine}
